    # ticket 20260912-004800): ShowShareUIForWindow silently never
    # delivers DataRequested when its target window is not actually the
    # OS foreground window at the moment of the call -- confirmed
    # deterministic (only the first one or two real calls in a process
    # ever succeeded without this; 10/10 succeeded with it, across both
    # fresh windows and reuse of the same window). A real application's
    # own "Share" trigger almost always fires from its already-foreground
